          "filename": "Dhammikarama Burmese Buddhist Temple (12290122735).jpg",
          "caption": "The inner buildings of the Dhammikarama Burmese Buddhist Temple, among which is this gorgeous gold plated stupa, typically Thai (we'd seen one in the Thai reclining Buddha temple opposite- ref. previous few pictures), but this is apparently a feature in Burma as well.  (Georgetown, Penang, Malaysia, Nov. 2013)",
